00:06:29.280 --> 00:06:33.819
Bernie has given us the price tag and now
you can argue Bernie's price tag is wrong

00:06:33.819 --> 00:06:34.980
if you want to.

00:06:34.980 --> 00:06:39.129
That's a legitimate conversation to have,
but to continue to pretend that Bernie has

00:06:39.129 --> 00:06:41.210
never addressed the cost of his plan.

00:06:41.210 --> 00:06:48.090
Again, more of this staging by CNN, which
we'll have more about tomorrow, that was adversarial

00:06:48.090 --> 00:06:49.430
to Bernie to save a lease.

00:06:49.430 --> 00:06:54.900
They also focused on the cost of healthcare
without ever mentioning the cost of Wars or

00:06:54.900 --> 00:07:00.259
